<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov sugar exports up 16.53 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov sugar exports up 16.53 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's sugar exports reached 4.9726 million tonnes in the first 11 months, up 16.53 percent from a year earlier, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China exported 448,100 tonnes of sugar in November alone, the bureau said without giving a comparison.</p>
</text>
